{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relic Abyss is an action-filled anomaly that mixes lovecraftian fantasy with medieval sci-fi, bundled in a cute art-style and a banger soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo only contains the first chapter of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/About_Loop.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a desolate yet beautiful world being consumed by the Abyss. Embark on a quest to preserve existence, meeting fellow adventurers along the way! Discover ancient relics, forge powerful gear, and evolve your skills to defeat primal evil and prevent catastrophe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<strong>Play the 5 base adventurers (20 available in the full game.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Demo_Character_Select.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>Unique Character Skills including Ultimate Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Arrow_Rain.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcaa<strong>Choose your own build path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Stats.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2692\ufe0f<strong>Upgrade your equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Smithing.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf<strong>Collect enemy cards and enchant your gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Enchanting.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51<strong>Discover powerful relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Relics.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0fProcedurally generated levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Shrines.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728<strong>Randomized Perks System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Perks.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd91<strong>Battle otherworldly bosses</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Boss.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f<strong>City builder elements in an expansive HUB level</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/HUB.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd3<strong>Training to improve your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Training.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7a<strong>Incremental Difficulty Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Level_Select.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also features over 1 hour and 40 minutes soundtrack. Each level will have 5 Unique soundtracks playing. All passionately composed by &quot;Buch Dacanay&quot;! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The general theme for the soundtrack is &quot;Positive Depression&quot;, which perfectly matches the themes explored in the game's storyline.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694300?t=1747502472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694300?t=1747502472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/02a99dcc7d2c6c770b9388fbb7d7b312122d53fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747502472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/02a99dcc7d2c6c770b9388fbb7d7b312122d53fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747502472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relic Abyss is an action-filled anomaly that mixes lovecraftian fantasy with medieval sci-fi, bundled in a cute art-style and a banger soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo only contains the first chapter of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/About_Loop.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a desolate yet beautiful world being consumed by the Abyss. Embark on a quest to preserve existence, meeting fellow adventurers along the way! Discover ancient relics, forge powerful gear, and evolve your skills to defeat primal evil and prevent catastrophe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<strong>Play the 5 base adventurers (20 available in the full game.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Demo_Character_Select.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25<strong>Unique Character Skills including Ultimate Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Arrow_Rain.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcaa<strong>Choose your own build path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Stats.png?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2692\ufe0f<strong>Upgrade your equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Smithing.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf<strong>Collect enemy cards and enchant your gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Enchanting.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51<strong>Discover powerful relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Relics.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0fProcedurally generated levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694300/extras/Shrines.gif?t=1747502472\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728<strong>Rando